Two regions

`EU region` holds `EU API` and `EU database`. `US region` holds `US API` and
`US database`. Each API writes to the database in its own region. The two
databases replicate to each other, with the label `replicate`.
---
EU region { EU API, EU database }
US region { US API, US database }
EU API -> EU database
US API -> US database
EU database -> US database: replicate
US database -> EU database: replicate
